          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " them.",
          "start": 1553.18,
          "end": 1553.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the incidents in the Quran where God revived the dead.",
