          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 1556.66,
          "end": 1556.84,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " revived",
          "start": 1556.84,
          "end": 1557.18,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 1557.18,
          "end": 1557.4,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " dead.",
          "start": 1557.4,
          "end": 1557.6,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But with Moses, this was done actually, it was computerized to teach us that this earth cannot stand the presence of God.",
      "start": 1559.12,
      "end": 1564.64,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
