        },
        {
          "word": " baby.\"",
          "start": 2455.84,
          "end": 2456.22,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Then as soon as God gives them a good baby, they forget their prayer.\" They become preoccupied with the baby.",
