    },
    {
      "text": "\"On faith\" is a very difficult word to translate.",
      "start": 2662.7,
      "end": 2665.89,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " \"On",
          "start": 2662.7,
          "end": 2662.96,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " faith\"",
          "start": 2662.96,
          "end": 2663.32,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 2663.62,
          "end": 2663.68,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 2663.68,
          "end": 2663.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " very",
          "start": 2663.88,
          "end": 2664.1,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " difficult",
          "start": 2664.3,
          "end": 2664.4,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " word",
          "start": 2664.4,
          "end": 2664.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 2664.82,
          "end": 2665.24,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " translate.",
          "start": 2665.24,
          "end": 2665.89,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Arabic it's \"Bilghayb (\u0628\u0650\u0671\u0644\u0652\u063a\u064e\u064a\u0652\u0628\u0650).\"",
      "start": 2666.78,
      "end": 2668.48,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " In",
          "start": 2666.78,
          "end": 2666.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Arabic",
          "start": 2666.78,
          "end": 2667.02,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " it's",
          "start": 2667.02,
          "end": 2667.3,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"Bilghayb",
          "start": 2667.3,
          "end": 2667.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " (\u0628\u0650\u0671\u0644\u0652\u063a\u064e\u064a\u0652\u0628\u0650).\"",
          "start": 2667.86,
          "end": 2668.48,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'm always torn between translating it as \"on faith\" or \"when in privacy.\"",
      "start": 2669.44,
      "end": 2677.06,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 2669.44,
          "end": 2670.0,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " I'm",
          "start": 2670.0,
          "end": 2670.6,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " always",
          "start": 2670.6,
          "end": 2670.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " torn",
          "start": 2670.86,
          "end": 2671.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " between",
          "start": 2671.26,
          "end": 2671.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " translating",
          "start": 2671.78,
          "end": 2672.36,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " it",
          "start": 2672.36,
          "end": 2672.7,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " as",
          "start": 2672.7,
          "end": 2672.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"on",
          "start": 2672.88,
          "end": 2673.06,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " faith\"",
          "start": 2673.15,
          "end": 2673.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " or",
          "start": 2673.9,
          "end": 2673.9,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"when",
          "start": 2673.9,
          "end": 2674.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 2674.86,
          "end": 2675.0,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " privacy.\"",
          "start": 2675.34,
          "end": 2677.06,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"When in their privacy.\"",
      "start": 2677.08,
      "end": 2677.69,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " \"When",
          "start": 2677.08,
          "end": 2677.08,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 2677.08,
          "end": 2677.2,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " their",
          "start": 2677.2,
          "end": 2677.34,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " privacy.\"",
          "start": 2677.34,
          "end": 2677.69,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They don't see that.",
      "start": 2678.82,
      "end": 2679.66,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " They",
          "start": 2678.82,
          "end": 2678.82,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " don't",
          "start": 2678.82,
          "end": 2679.02,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " see",
          "start": 2679.02,
          "end": 2679.16,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " that.",
          "start": 2679.16,
          "end": 2679.66,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. There are people who are in this mosque and they say \"We believe you're God's messenger.\" But they will not profess that outside.",
