          "start": 4227.72,
          "end": 4228.02,
          "speaker": "The people [Jews] in France made it a custom to add [in the morning prayer] the words"
        },
        {
          "word": " wrong.",
          "start": 4228.02,
          "end": 4228.52,
          "speaker": "The people [Jews] in France made it a custom to add [in the morning prayer] the words"
        },
        {
          "word": " It",
          "start": 4229.04,
          "end": 4229.12,
          "speaker": "The people [Jews] in France made it a custom to add [in the morning prayer] the words"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It is all gross falsehood, because there are only nineteen times..",
      "start": 4229.12,
      "end": 4233.58,
      "speaker": "The people [Jews] in France made it a custom to add [in the morning prayer] the words",
