        },
        {
          "word": " from?\"",
          "start": 4924.46,
          "end": 4924.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " It's,",
          "start": 4927.4,
          "end": 4927.58,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It's, we learn from Quran that we are here. We have no recollection of our previous past.",
