          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 5336.98,
          "end": 5336.98,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "God knew that some of us, deep in our hearts, we really believed in God's absolute authority.",
